    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Linux audit subsystem provides mandatory, tamper-resistant logging of security-relevant events:",
      "source_hash": 4193943634201222319,
      "context_hash": 3970109327036184907,
      "translation": "Linux audit 서브시스템은 보안 관련 이벤트를 강제적이고 변조에 강한 방식으로 기록합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "subsystem": "서브시스템"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:23.258106Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Syscall execution (who called `open()`, `execve()`, `setuid()`?)",
      "source_hash": 9324616535950651404,
      "context_hash": 8304147427670450880,
      "translation": "시스템 콜 실행(누가 `open()`, `execve()`, `setuid()`를 호출했는가?)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
